# Electric tools

ent-RUMCElectricScrewdriver = electric screwdriver
    .desc = A screwdriver with a motor in the handle: it turns screws on its own, twice as fast. Takes a power cell.

ent-RUMCElectricWrench = electric wrench
    .desc = A wrench with a motor: it tightens and loosens bolts for you, twice as fast. Takes a power cell.

ent-RUMCElectricWirecutters = electric wirecutters
    .desc = Wirecutters with a motor and a hydraulic jaw: they bite through cable at once. Takes a power cell.

ent-RUMCElectricCrowbar = electric crowbar
    .desc = A crowbar with a jack in it: it pries open what the plain one cannot, and quicker. Takes a power cell.

ent-RUMCElectricHammer = electric hammer
    .desc = A hammer driven by a piston: it works as the hammering tool for the crafts, and hits hard. Takes a power cell.

ent-RUMCPowerDrill = power drill
    .desc = A drill with a battery pack: it can screw and unscrew, and it holds bolts too. Quicker than both of the hand tools it replaces.

ent-RUMCElectricShovel = electric shovel
    .desc = A shovel with a motor on the blade: it digs a pit in half the time. Takes a power cell. A dig takes three charges.

ent-RUMCElectricPickaxe = electric pickaxe
    .desc = A pickaxe with a piston behind the head: it breaks rock in half the time. Takes a power cell. A dig takes three charges.

ent-RUMCProspector = prospector
    .desc = A device that listens to the ground: it tells how many deposits of ore and of oil lie around, how far and which way. Takes a power cell.

