ent-RUMCJackhammer = jackhammer
    .desc = A heavy battery-powered jackhammer. Only it can break the black stone, so only it can break through to the lava layer. It also digs pits through plain stone much faster than a pickaxe. Every blow brings a wall down and takes a charge from the cell.

